WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
Schwa is the lazy uh sound in a word.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.670
You can’t hear which vowel it is.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:09.750
So find a cousin of the word where the vowel is loud.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.830
Opposite sounds like uh in the middle.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.380
But oppose says its o clearly.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.530
So opposite has an o.
